        <body>
            <div xml:id="d409">

                <pb facs="0622" n="534" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg534"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hirsch to Mr. Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-01-27"><hi rendition="#italic">January 27, 1892</hi></date>.
                        (Received February 12.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 382.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose herewith a copy
                    in translation of a note verbale from the Sublime Porte in answer to the note
                    verbale of this legation of January 9, on the subject of the “Conversion of
                    private houses into temples and schools by the American missionaries.”</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Solomon Hirsch.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d409-a1.xml" xpointer="d409-a1"/>
